2026-10-06 10:58:40 [deepseek-flash] one file per session, not one big JSON.
2026-10-06 10:58:40 [deepseek-flash] 
2026-10-06 10:58:40 [deepseek-flash] If you tell me which of those two summary targets you actually want, the pass-1 record and the
2026-10-06 10:58:40 [deepseek-flash] segmentation rules become concrete enough to sketch as functions.
